pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B5"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Mita</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Kasahara</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Sasaki</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Nagayasu</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Yamada</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Kanamori</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Namiki</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Kitagawa</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Yamashita</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Yasukochi</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><etal></etal></person-group><article-title>The genome sequence of silkworm, <italic>Bombyx mori</italic></article-title><source>DNA Res</source><year>2004</year><volume>11</volume><fpage>27</fpage><lpage>35</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15141943</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1093/dnares/11.1.27</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B6"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Xia</surname><given-names>Q</given-names></name><name><surname>Zhou</surname><given-names>Z</given-names></name><name><surname>Lu</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Cheng</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Dai</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Li</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Zhao</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Zha</surname><given-names>X</given-names></name><name><surname>Cheng</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Chai</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><etal></etal></person-group><article-title>A draft sequence for the genome of the domesticated silkworm (<italic>Bombyx mori</italic>)</article-title><source>Sci