name>Schroeder</surname><given-names>AJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Gramates</surname><given-names>LS</given-names></name><name><surname>St Pierre</surname><given-names>SE</given-names></name><etal></etal></person-group><article-title>Revisiting the protein-coding gene catalog of <italic>Drosophila melanogaster </italic>using 12 fly genomes</article-title><source>Genome Res</source><year>2007</year><volume>17</volume><fpage>1823</fpage><lpage>1836</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17989253</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1101/gr.6679507</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Deng</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Dong</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Thodima</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name><name><surname>Clem</surname><given-names>RJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Passarelli</surname><given-names>AL</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Analysis and functional annotation of expressed sequence tags from the fall armyworm <italic>Spodoptera frugiperda</italic></article-title><source>BMC Genomics</source><year>2006</year><volume>7</volume><fpage>264</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17052344</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1186/1471-2164-7-264</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Grimmelikhuijzen</surname><given-names>CJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Cazzamali</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Williamson</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Hauser</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The promise of insect genomics</article-title><source>Pest Manag Sci</source><year>2007</year><volume>63</volume><fpage>413</fpage><lpage>416</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17377971</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1002/ps